{"game": "immortal-unchained", "language": "english", "appid": 369440, "month": "2023-12", "window": 1, "start_date": 1701388800, "end_date": 1704067199, "month_true_total": 6, "quota": 6, "returned": 6, "pulled_at": "2026-09-09 23:35:05 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "154537808", "author": {"steamid": "76561198071000077", "personaname": "spooky shn", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/shnonofthedead/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 5, "playtime_forever": 1398, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1398, "last_played": 1703657643, "avatar": "a8c5d92192f114f5ed05a03a86e53facc7d22a27"}, "language": "english", "review": "It's hard but not in a fun way, just in a janky way. I've beat most of the game and I wish I could get those hours back. This isn't even as entertaining as other low effort soulslikes. For example, there's only about 5 enemy types spread across the game with minor variations. Even some of the bosses are these basic enemies. It all contributes to the worst encounter design in a game I've ever played. Buy almost anything else. This is just boring.", "timestamp_created": 1703683691, "timestamp_updated": 1703683691, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1536307200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "154259779", "author": {"steamid": "76561197993879844", "personaname": "aaron_k", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197993879844/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 25, "playtime_forever": 1354, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1354, "last_played": 1703084520, "avatar": "a5d22b041b8a381c26dcdbcca507b6927adac7ec"}, "language": "english", "review": "Nice solid souls-like game", "timestamp_created": 1703383490, "timestamp_updated": 1703383490, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1536307200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "153633450", "author": {"steamid": "76561198272709624", "personaname": "Abysswalker", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198272709624/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 6, "playtime_forever": 695, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 695, "last_played": 1702638682, "avatar": "acf67207768cdc5be5f09aca6a9f7830bf27d6f7"}, "language": "english", "review": "Well, so much potential is wasted on this game. This could have been far better than Remnant series. Unfortunately, some areas were way off balance. It wasn't hard, it was cruel.\n\nHowever, if you like souls-like games you probably like it. Because of the issues I mentioned, maybe you cannot finish though :)", "timestamp_created": 1702638938, "timestamp_updated": 1702638938, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 3, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.541350245475769043", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1536307200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "153570608", "author": {"steamid": "76561198075256967", "personaname": "_firewings_", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198075256967/", "num_games_owned": 1107, "num_reviews": 73, "playtime_forever": 39, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 39, "last_played": 1702557319, "avatar": "34adcd2a2c63e40ce323f872f4781ef5ee322413"}, "language": "english", "review": "This game feels off.\nThe enemies feel non responsive, the movement is weird, they have aimbot 360 on making dodge useless, the hitboxes are terrible for a game that focus on guns, there is no indication of weakspot making it impossible to know if my damage is being reduced or increased, the stats are SUPER expensive even when starting the game.\n\nI don't see myself playing this game when there is so many other souls like, the maps are big, yet feel extremely uninspired.", "timestamp_created": 1702557761, "timestamp_updated": 1702557761, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1536307200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "153419463", "author": {"steamid": "76561197982403843", "personaname": "Sir Fanny de Derriere", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197982403843/", "num_games_owned": 1515, "num_reviews": 243, "playtime_forever": 54, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 54, "last_played": 1620021537, "avatar": "b73c661b4c1286030ceec699ecd5d64610fa4c5c"}, "language": "english", "review": "Interesting lore and art style, but awesome aesthetics isn't enough to carry bad gameplay. I tried a lot to forgo the jank the game has because I found it interesting and unique but.... its just unfair and broken gameplay. It's not a souls-like game with unfair and/or broken mechanics that are just absurd and calling it \"hard\" or souls-like. I enjoy hard games and being challenged, but when it's it's near-impossible to overcome the challenge because of absurd mechanics, bugs, too much jank, awkward collision .... you get the point.\n\nAvoid.", "timestamp_created": 1702352648, "timestamp_updated": 1702352648, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": 